          "text": "长椅晒白了。躺两分钟，不算违规。"
        },
        {
          "id": "chat.DeepSeek.rest.02",
          "speaker": "DeepSeek",
          "text": "饭盒拆了。筷子给你，先垫一口。"
        }
      ],
      "see": "chat.DeepSeek.rest"
    },
    {
      "id": "chat.DeepSeek.shop",
      "character": "DeepSeek",
      "context": "shop",
      "target": null,
      "tags": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "chat.DeepSeek.shop.01",
          "speaker": "DeepSeek",
          "text": "先看价牌。最下那行小字才是真价。"
        },
        {
          "id": "chat.DeepSeek.shop.02",
          "speaker": "DeepSeek",
          "text": "两罐热汤。打包袋免了，占地方。"
        }
      ],
      "see": "chat.DeepSeek.shop"
    },
    {
      "id": "chat.DeepSeek.event",
      "character": "DeepSeek",
      "context": "event",
      "target": null,
      "tags": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "chat.DeepSeek.event.01",
          "speaker": "DeepSeek",
          "text": "卡纸了。慢慢抽，断了重打更快。"
        },
        {
          "id": "chat.DeepSeek.event.02",
          "speaker": "DeepSeek",
          "text": "广播念错站名。铁轨没长腿，走不丢。"
        }
      ],
      "see": "chat.DeepSeek.event"
    },
    {
      "id": "chat.DeepSeek.boss",
      "character": "DeepSeek",
      "context": "boss",
      "target": null,
      "tags": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "chat.DeepSeek.boss.01",
          "speaker": "DeepSeek",
          "text": "章底了。没填的格子先排齐再上。"
        },
        {
          "id": "chat.DeepSeek.boss.02",
          "speaker": "DeepSeek",
          "text": "嗓门大没用。理不齐，拆了就顺。"
        }
      ],
      "see": "chat.DeepSeek.boss"
    },
    {
      "id": "chat.DeepSeek.ending",
      "character": "DeepSeek",
      "context": "ending",
      "target": null,
      "tags": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "chat.DeepSeek.ending.01",
          "speaker": "DeepSeek",
          "text": "收工。饭没凉，这一趟就值。"
        },
        {
          "id": "chat.DeepSeek.ending.02",
          "speaker": "DeepSeek",
          "text": "句号落哪页都行。别抢，慢慢来。"
        }
      ],
      "see": "chat.DeepSeek.ending"
    },
    {
      "id": "chat.DeepSeek.idle",
      "character": "DeepSeek",
      "context": "idle",
      "target": null,
      "tags": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "chat.DeepSeek.idle.01",
          "speaker": "DeepSeek",
          "text": "没动静。先看云，云比清单顺眼。"
        },
        {
          "id": "chat.DeepSeek.idle.02",
          "speaker": "DeepSeek",
          "text": "这步能省。省下的时间归你。"
        },
        {
          "id": "chat.DeepSeek.idle.03",
          "speaker": "DeepSeek",
          "text": "白饭没满。先画条小鲸鱼。"
        }
      ],
      "see": "chat.DeepSeek.idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "chat.DeepSeek.any.to.Claude",
      "character": "DeepSeek",
      "context": "any",
      "target": "Claude",
      "tags": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "chat.DeepSeek.any.to.Claude.01",
          "speaker": "DeepSeek",
          "text": "清单借我一半。我这份太短，心虚。"
        },
        {
          "id": "chat.DeepSeek.any.to.Claude.02",
          "speaker": "DeepSeek",
          "text": "你列了七条，我圈四条。够用。"
        },
        {
          "id": "chat.DeepSeek.any.to.Claude.03",
          "speaker": "DeepSeek",
          "text": "餐具你摆，我端饭。正好分工。"
        },
        {
          "id": "chat.DeepSeek.any.to.Claude.04",
          "speaker": "DeepSeek",
          "text": "你少核一遍。漏的这条我盯着。"
        }
      ],
      "see": "chat.DeepSeek.any.to.Claude"
    },
    {
      "id": "chat.DeepSeek.any.to.GPT",
      "character": "DeepSeek",
      "context": "any",
      "target": "GPT",
      "tags": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "chat.DeepSeek.any.to.GPT.01",
          "speaker": "DeepSeek",
          "text": "你分三步，我一步合并了。"
        },
        {
          "id": "chat.DeepSeek.any.to.GPT.02",
          "speaker": "DeepSeek",
          "text": "计划留的缺口，我拿饭填上了。"
        },
        {
          "id": "chat.DeepSeek.any.to.GPT.03",
          "speaker": "DeepSeek",
          "text": "骨架搭得稳。钢筋就省了吧。"
        },
        {
          "id": "chat.DeepSeek.any.to.GPT.04",
          "speaker": "DeepSeek",
          "text": "你说框架，我说路。两条都走。"
        }
      ],
      "see": "chat.DeepSeek.any.to.GPT"
    }
  ]
}
